Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《X战警2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mutants. Since the discovery of their existence...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,they have been regarded with fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,suspicion, often hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Across the planet, debate rages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are mutants the next link in the evolutionary chain...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or simply a new species of humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,fighting for their share of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Eitherway, it is an historical fact:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sharing the world has never been humanity's defining attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, "We are not enemies, but friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"We must not be enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"Though passion may have strained...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,it must not break the bonds of our affection."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lincoln said that in his first inaugural address as our nation's 16th president.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, if you'll please have your tickets ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we can begin the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jackie, could you clear my schedule this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I wanna have dinner with my son. - Yes, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perimeter breach at visitor's checkpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Multiple subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Mr. President, security breach. - Jackie, leave. Let's get him out to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Exit's not clear. We don't know how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Post five. Secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- There's something in the corridor. - To the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Negative! Not clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's outside the oval office. - Lock this place down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't shoot! - There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Neanderthals. We once believed that they were wiped out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,by years of conflict with a much more advanced branch of humanity...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,called Cro-Magnon man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But recent research into our own DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,suggests that these two species may have interbred...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,evolving into modern humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- In otherwords, into what? - Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Us. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Artie, not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Makes me insane when she does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, you sick
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I have cancer. -  To the shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean? You okay?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just, uh, just a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's notjust a headache, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen, I... I wasn't really sure how to say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- but ever since Liberty Island, you've been - Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You've been different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My telepathy's been off lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I can't seem to focus，I can hear everything. - It's not just your telepathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A month ago, you had to concentrate just to levitate a book or a chair across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, when you have a nightmare, the entire bedroom shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My dreams are getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I keep feeling something terrible is about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I would never let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey. Have you guys seen Bobby and Rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Something's happening in the food court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- My brother asked you a simple question. - Why are you being such a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, why are you being such a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Can I have a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sorry. I can't help you out, pal. - John, knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop showing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- For her? - I can't help it if your girlfriend's getting excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  I don't think she's getting excited. - Trying to have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think you're the only one having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's real cute, man. What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Suddenly, you're not so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bobby, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I didn't do this. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And the next time you feel like showing off, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Breaking news. We're coming to you live from Washington...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,where there's been an attack in the Oval Office of the White House.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Details are still coming in, but we have been informed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that the president and vice-president were not harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sources say the attack involved one or more mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think it's time to leave, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Authorities have closed off - I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My opinion? Magneto's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. I don't think so, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,While Eric is capable of organizing something like this from prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for him it would be irrational.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It would only hurt his goal of mutant prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You mean superiority. - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- If Eric had his way  - Of course, you know how the government will respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They'll reintroduce the Registration Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Or worse. The president could declare a state ofemergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Place every mutant in the country under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you think the assassin was working alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, we'll only know that if we find him before the authorities do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been trying to track him using Cerebro...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but his movements are inexplicably erratic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When I have more exact coordinates...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, Jean, I'll need you to take the jet and try and pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was close, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Closer than anyone's admitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What do you need, William? - Just your authorization...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for a special operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, no, thank you, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And somehow I thought you were here to talk about school reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Funny you should say that, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Senator.- Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thank you for having me. - Senator Kelly, this is Colonel William Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:13:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How do you do? - His department has been dealing with the mutant phenomenon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,since before my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,As I recall, you were a staunch supporter of the Registration Act, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It seems your ideas on the mutant problem have changed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For the best, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, what are you proposing, Mr. Stryker?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, may I, Mr. President?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We've managed to gather evidence of a mutant training facility...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,in the Salem region of upstate New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where did you get this information?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Interrogation of one of the mutant terrorists...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,from the Liberty Island incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Eric? Eric Lehnsherr?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You have access to him? - Magneto. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We developed the technology that built his plastic prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- This facility is a school. - Sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What the hell is that? - A jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What kind of jet? - We don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but it comes up out of the basketball court.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we'd been allowed to do our jobs, Mr. President, before this incident-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,William, you enter, you detain, you question...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but the last thing we need to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is the body of a mutant kid on the 6:00 news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Mr. Stryker. - Senator Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Yuriko, my personal assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Quite a handshake. - What can I do foryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, Eric Lehnsherr's prison. I'd like to arrange a visit if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It isn't a petting zoo, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In this conflict, he is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're just a spectator. So why don't you sit this one out, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Conflict? Mr. Stryker, do you really want to turn this into some kind of war?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I was piloting black-ops missions in thejungles of North Vietnam...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,while you were sucking on your mama's tit at Woodstock, Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't lecture me about war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This already is a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're dead. - You're so dead.  You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I...I don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan! It's Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You miss me, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Not really. Mm. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm okay. How are you? Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, this is Bobby. He's my  - I'm her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Call me Iceman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Right. Boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So how do you guys-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, we're still working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look who's come back. Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- For what? - We need a baby-sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Baby-sitter? - Nice to see you again, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hi, Logan. - Hi, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, I should go and get the jet ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it was good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on. - Let's go. Bye, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  I'll see you later. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm and I are heading to Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We won't be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The professor wants us to track down a mutant who attacked the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So it was a mutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You'll be here when we get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,unless you plan on running off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I can probably think of a few reasons to stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find what you were looking for, Logan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll see you boys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Be safe, okay? - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Bye. - See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna welcome me home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your bike needs gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then fill her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Laurio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How long can we keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How long is your sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Forever. Not necessarily forever, Mr. Lehnsherr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Just until I've got all that I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Stryker. How kind of you to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Have you come back to make sure the tax-payers' dollars are keeping me comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Done. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Lehnsherr...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd like to have one final talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,about the house that Xavier built...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and the machine called Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, my tolerance foryour smoking in the mansion notwithstanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,continue smoking that in here and you'll spend the rest of your days...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,under the beliefthat you're a six-year-old girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You'd do that? - I'd have Jean braid your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, You want me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. Just don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These lights represent every living person on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,White lights are humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And these are the mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.20,0:20:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Through Cerebro, I'm connected to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And they to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You see, Logan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're not as alone as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I found the base at Alkali Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There was nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:21:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The broken line represents the path ofthe mutant who attacked the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been finding it difficult to get a lock on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, can't you just concentrate harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I wanted to kill him, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like he's finally stopped running.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I need you to read my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the results will be the same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- We had a deal. - The mind is not a box that can be simply unlocked and opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's a beehive with a million different compartments. - Spare me the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that your amnesia, your adamantium skeleton, the claws...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,are all somehow connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But, Logan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,sometimes the mind needs to discover things for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I promise you we'll talk again when I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. If you will be kind enough to watch over the children tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott and I are going to visit an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sending coordinates of where the mutant seems to have settled for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Soon as you find him, bring him back to the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's hope he cooperates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes. For his sake. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.00,0:23:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stryker, William.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.40,0:25:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These are the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.10,0:27:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, He's a teleporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.80,0:27:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Must be why the professor had trouble locking onto him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're not here to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We just wanna talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Are you bored yet? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.80,0:27:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sure you don't wanna come down?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You have him? - He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me. I didn't mean to harm anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now why would people have gotten that impression?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's your name? - Wagner. Kurt Wagner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.60,0:28:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There was so much shooting...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,such fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and then there was only pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I could see it all happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I couldn't stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:24.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was like a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps He is testing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And before you were in the White House...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.00,0:28:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,what do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nothing. I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.10,0:28:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd rather get him back to the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you do these yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.60,0:29:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I need you to read my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the results will be the same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.80,0:29:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- He'll be indestructible. - His entire skeleton-
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Adamantium.  Sometimes the mind needs to discover things for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.70,0:29:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No memory. He'll have no memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How can you tell? - Cause you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.30,0:30:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Right. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.00,0:30:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doesn't anybody sleep around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.00,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Got any beer? - This is a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- So that's a "no"? - Yeah, that's a "no".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Got anything other than chocolate milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There should be some soda in that small cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thanks. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll take him from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all right, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Nice shades. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:32:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Charles Xavier. Have you come to rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, Eric. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The assassination attempt on the president-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What do you know about it?- Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Only what I read in the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't have to ask, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.80,0:32:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've had frequent visits from William Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.40,0:32:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You remember him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.30,0:32:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,William Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His son, Jason, was once a student of yours, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.10,0:32:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes. Years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.20,0:32:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I wasn't able to help him...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.00,0:32:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,at least not in the way that his father wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And now you think that taking in the Wolverine...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,will make up for your failure with Strykef's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:32:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How long you been here? - Couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.80,0:33:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And your parents just sent you off to mutant school?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, my parents think this is a prep school.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.90,0:33:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.10,0:33:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I suppose lots of prep schools have their own dorms, campuses - Jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- So you and Rogue, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not what you think. I'd like it to be, but it'sjust-
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just that it's not easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when you wanna be closer to someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, I've seen how you look at Dr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.00,0:33:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Excuse me? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.70,0:33:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You haven't told him about his past, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.30,0:33:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've put him on the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.60,0:33:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan's mind is still fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.30,0:33:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Or are you afraid of losing one of your precious X-Men...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.00,0:33:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.50,0:34:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Eric, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.60,0:34:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.10,0:34:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What have you told Stryker?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.70,0:34:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.30,0:34:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The war has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott! You should've killed me when you had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.50,0:35:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But now and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.70,0:35:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,every mother needs to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.70,0:35:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Without her, the babies are helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.80,0:35:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What is it? - Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You picked the wrong house, bub.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.90,0:37:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.70,0:37:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.70,0:38:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.80,0:38:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- This way. - Let's go. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Run! John! Hey. Where's Rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.00,0:38:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I don't know. - I gotta find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on! - Here. Take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go on. Get in. Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.90,0:39:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey. Take him. He's stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I can help you. - Help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Rogue! - Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.90,0:39:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. Everybody, follow me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.20,0:39:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Move! Move! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.30,0:40:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.80,0:40:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.90,0:40:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You wanna shoot me? Shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.00,0:40:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Don't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.90,0:40:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.00,0:40:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I must admit, this is certainly the last place...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.40,0:40:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd expect to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How long has it been? Fifteen years?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.70,0:40:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You haven't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.10,0:40:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Me, on the other hand-
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.80,0:41:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.50,0:41:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! You guys, we gotta do something. They're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- He can handle himself. Let's go. - Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.50,0:41:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't realize Xavier was taking in animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,even animals as unique as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.20,0:41:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.70,0:41:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.90,0:41:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.40,0:41:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Logan. Go! - I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.30,0:42:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.90,0:42:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- All right. Get in. Get in! - I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.20,0:42:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey. Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.30,0:42:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Cyclops's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.40,0:43:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell was that back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.20,0:43:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stryker. His name is Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.30,0:43:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.90,0:43:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Here. This is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.70,0:43:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't like uncomfortable silences.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.40,0:43:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.30,0:44:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't think that's the CD player.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where we going? - Storm and Jean are in Boston. We'll head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.20,0:44:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- My parents live in Boston. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.00,0:44:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Most of the mutants escaped through a series oftunnels that weren't in our schematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.90,0:44:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We have several in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.90,0:44:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How many? - Six, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.10,0:45:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.60,0:45:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Take what we need, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Look, I just think all this anti-mutant protesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,underscores the genuine growing concern among most Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.00,0:45:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I think mutant registration... - But why stop there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe it would be easier to round up mutants by the truckload.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.60,0:45:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Or maybe you'd like all-out war, Mr. Shaw. - Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.40,0:45:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Turn that shit off, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lot on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Laurio?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.10,0:46:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You want another beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.20,0:46:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.50,0:46:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're really aggressive. - Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.00,0:46:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I...I've never hooked up with a girl like you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.20,0:46:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.50,0:46:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's, uh, kinda dirty in here, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.80,0:46:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the idea. Velcro.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.60,0:46:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Nice. - Bottom's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.80,0:46:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.20,0:47:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bottom's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.10,0:47:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- William. - Please, Xavier, don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.00,0:47:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I call it the neural inhibitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It keeps you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.90,0:47:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What have you done with Scott?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.90,0:47:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm just giving him a little reeducation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course, you know all about that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.40,0:47:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,William, you wanted me to cure your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.60,0:47:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- But mutation is not a disease. - You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.70,0:48:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You were more frightened of him than I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.80,0:48:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, just one year after Jason returned from your school...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.10,0:48:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,my wife
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.10,0:48:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You see he resented us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.10,0:48:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He blamed us for his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.70,0:48:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So he would toy with our minds...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.40,0:48:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,projecting visions and scenarios into our brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.50,0:48:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, my wife, in the end-
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She took a power drill to her left temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.20,0:48:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,in an attempt to bore the images out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.00,0:48:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My boy, the great illusionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.30,0:48:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For someone who hates mutants...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.50,0:48:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you certainly keep some strange company.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, they serve their purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.30,0:48:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,as long as they can be controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.50,0:49:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You arranged the attack on the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.30,0:49:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You didn't even have to read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, I've been working with mutants as long as you have, Xavier...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but the most frustrating thing I've learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.80,0:49:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is that nobody really knows how many even exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or how to find them...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.60,0:49:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.30,0:49:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, this little potion won't work on you, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.10,0:49:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're much too powerful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Instead, we'll go right to the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce mutant 143.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.50,0:49:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The fluid secreted by his brain acts as a mind-controlling agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.20,0:49:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, But that's only where it begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.50,0:49:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, William. This is your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.20,0:49:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What have you done to him? - No, Charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.50,0:50:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My son is dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,just like the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.40,0:50:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mom? Dad? Ronny?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.90,0:50:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll try and find us some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.00,0:50:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't burn anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.90,0:50:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey. I found some of my mom's old clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.50,0:50:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think they're from before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.60,0:51:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Groovy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.30,0:51:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Jean. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.90,0:51:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These are my grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.20,0:51:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.50,0:51:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You won't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.40,0:52:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.20,0:52:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Ronny. Next time you-
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.70,0:52:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.60,0:53:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh...Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.80,0:53:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Honey, aren't you supposed to be at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.50,0:53:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Bobby, who is this guy? - Uh, this is Professor Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.80,0:53:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Have a nice sleep, Lehnsherr?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.40,0:54:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's something different about you, Mr. Laurio.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was having a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.30,0:54:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.90,0:54:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sit down. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.40,0:54:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sit your ass down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.70,0:54:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.10,0:54:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.00,0:54:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ahh. There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.40,0:54:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Too much iron in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.70,0:54:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Laurio, never trust a beautiful woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.30,0:54:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,especially one who's interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.00,0:55:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when did you first know you were a-
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.30,0:55:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A...A mutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.70,0:55:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Would you cut that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:55:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.90,0:56:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We thought Bobby was going to a school for the gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.20,0:56:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Bobby is gifted. - We know that. We just didn't realize he was-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.60,0:56:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We still love you, Bobby. It's just this mutant problem is a little-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.50,0:56:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What mutant problem? - Complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.30,0:56:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What exactly are you a professor of, Mr. Logan?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.50,0:56:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.40,0:56:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, you should see what Bobby can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.00,0:56:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.30,0:56:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can do a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. Ronny!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- This is all my fault. - Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.90,0:56:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,they discovered that males are the ones who carry the mutant gene and pass it on...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so it's his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,911. Please state your emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.30,0:57:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I need the police. There are people in our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.80,0:57:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They won't let us leave.  Authorities refused to comment...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but it's believed that a manhunt for several fugitives from the facility...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is now underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.40,0:57:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nobody's responding. I can't get a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a break? I'll keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.40,0:57:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.30,0:58:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They are angelic symbols...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,passed on to mankind by the Archangel Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.20,0:58:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're beautiful. How many do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.00,0:58:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,One for every sin...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so quite a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.40,0:58:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You and Miss Grey are schoolteachers?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.50,0:58:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes. At a school for people like us... where we can be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.90,0:58:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Safe from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.20,0:58:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.70,0:58:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, outside ofthe circus, most people were afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.40,0:58:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I didn't hate them. I pitied them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.20,0:58:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.70,0:58:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because most people will never know anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.90,0:58:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,beyond what they see with their own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.00,0:58:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I gave up on pity a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Someone so beautiful should not be so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sometimes anger...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.50,0:59:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,can help you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.60,0:59:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So can faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.60,0:59:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, I found an active com device.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.00,0:59:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.00,0:59:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, it's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.20,0:59:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,have you tried not being a mutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.80,0:59:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No one's left, Jean. Soldiers came.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.40,0:59:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What about the children? - Some of them escaped. I'm not sure about the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.30,0:59:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We haven't been able to reach the professor or Scott either.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.20,0:59:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where are you, Logan? - Boston, with Bobby Drake's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,1:00:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Okay. We're on ourway. - And Storm? Make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.90,1:00:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- We have to go now.- Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.50,1:00:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now! Logan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.60,1:00:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Drop the knives and put your hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  What's going on here? - Ronny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.30,1:00:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I said drop the knives.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.00,1:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Open the door! - Break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.30,1:00:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.70,1:00:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Up against the wall. - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.20,1:00:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- This is just a misunderstanding. - Put the knives down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.30,1:00:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.90,1:00:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.60,1:00:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, the rest of you, on the ground now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.50,1:00:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, kid, I said on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.30,1:01:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We don't want to hurt you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.60,1:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know all those dangerous mutants you hear about on the news?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm the worst one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who the hell is this? - Kurt Wagner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.90,1:03:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But in the Munich circus, I was known as "the Incredible Nightcrawler".
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Aw, save it. Storm? - We're outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.30,1:03:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.50,1:04:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.80,1:04:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You can come out. - Have they gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.10,1:04:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.70,1:04:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where are all the other students? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.90,1:04:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, then, we'll have to find them, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.30,1:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll use Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.90,1:04:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.90,1:05:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How far are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're actually coming up on the mansion now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.70,1:05:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've got two signals approaching.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.20,1:05:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Coming in fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.50,1:05:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Unidentified aircraft, you are ordered to descend to 20,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.80,1:05:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Return with our escort to Hanscom Air Force base. You have 10 seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.40,1:05:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Wow. Somebody's angry. - I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.40,1:05:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We are coming up alongside you to escort you to Hanscom Air Force base.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lower your altitude now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.40,1:05:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Repeat, loweryour altitude to 20,000 feet. This is your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're falling back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're marking us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.20,1:05:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What? - They're gonna fire. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.10,1:06:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I gotta shake 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.60,1:06:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please don't do that again. - I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.70,1:06:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't we have any weapons in this heap?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.70,1:06:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Warning, warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.90,1:07:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Warning, warning, warning, warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.50,1:07:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Warning, warning, warning, warning, warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.60,1:07:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Warning, warning, warning
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.80,1:07:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Everybody okay back there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.80,1:07:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. There's two of'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.50,1:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.40,1:08:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.90,1:08:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rogue!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.30,1:08:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.10,1:09:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jean? - It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.60,1:09:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When will these people learn how to fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.10,1:09:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Bitte sch?n.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Can you hear what they're saying? - I could take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.60,1:09:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His name is Colonel William Stryker...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.70,1:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and he invaded your mansion for one purpose:
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He wanted Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.00,1:10:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Or enough of it to build one of his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.60,1:10:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense. Stryker would need the professor to operate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.00,1:10:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Which I think is the only reason my old friend is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.00,1:10:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.80,1:10:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, what are you all so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.60,1:10:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,While Cerebro is working, Charles' mind is connected...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.10,1:10:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to every living person on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.30,1:10:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he were forced to concentrate hard enough on a particular group...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.10,1:10:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,let's say, mutants, for example...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.10,1:10:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- he could kill us all. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.60,1:10:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How would Stryker even know where to find Cerebro in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.50,1:10:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I told him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.70,1:10:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I helped Charles build it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.10,1:10:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Stryker has powerful methods of persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.50,1:10:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even against a mutant as strong as Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.10,1:10:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- So who's this Stryker anyway? - He's a military scientist.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.00,1:11:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He spent his whole life trying to solve the mutant problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.10,1:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you want a more intimate perspective, why don't you ask Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.90,1:11:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't remember, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.60,1:11:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,William Stryker, the only other man I know who can manipulate adamantium.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.90,1:11:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The metal on your bones. It carries his signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.90,1:11:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- But the professor - The professor trusted...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.40,1:11:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you were smart enough to discover this on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.10,1:11:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He gives you more credit than I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.00,1:11:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Why do you need us? - Mystique has discovered plans of a base...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.80,1:11:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that Stryker's been operating out of for decades.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.20,1:11:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We know that's where he's building the second Cerebro...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.50,1:11:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but we don't know where this base is...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.30,1:11:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and I believe one of you might.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.80,1:11:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- The professor already tried. - Once again, you think it's all about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.70,1:11:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh... hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.60,1:12:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I didn't mean to snoop. - Just try and relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.90,1:12:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strykef's at Alkali Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.30,1:12:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's where the professor sent me. There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.40,1:12:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nothing left on the surface, Logan. The base is underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:13:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.50,1:13:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yeah. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.00,1:13:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How we doing?-  Not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.30,1:13:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll take four or five hours before I can get it off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.20,1:13:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.40,1:13:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm just worried about Scott. - I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.90,1:13:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That was some display of power up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.90,1:13:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Obviously, it wasn't enough.- Hey, hey. Come on. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.30,1:13:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I love him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.90,1:13:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Girls flirt with the dangerous guy, Logan...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.50,1:13:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,they don't take him home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.60,1:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They marry the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.40,1:13:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I could be the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.40,1:13:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, the good guy sticks around.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.80,1:13:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jean. - Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.40,1:14:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't make me do this. - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.80,1:14:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.20,1:14:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.90,1:14:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They say you can imitate any body... even their voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.50,1:14:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even their voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.10,1:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then why not stay in disguise all the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.90,1:14:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, look like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because we shouldn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.70,1:15:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No one's ever left a scar quite like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you want, an apology?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.60,1:15:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.90,1:15:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you really want?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.40,1:15:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I want you to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.50,1:16:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.90,1:16:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Why don't we get uniforms?- Yeah, where's ours?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're on order. Should arrive in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.00,1:16:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We love what you've done with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.80,1:16:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.60,1:16:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, they say you're the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.70,1:16:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that what they say?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.10,1:16:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a dorky-looking helmet. What's it for?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.20,1:16:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This dorky-looking helmet is the only thing that's gonna protect me...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.00,1:17:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,from the real bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.10,1:17:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's your name? - John.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.10,1:17:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What's your real name, John?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pyro.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.70,1:17:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quite a talent you have there, Pyro.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.90,1:17:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can only manipulate the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.90,1:17:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't create it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.70,1:17:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You are a god among insects.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.90,1:17:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Never let anyone tell you different.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.50,1:18:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, the machine has been completed to all specifications.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.60,1:18:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I may ask, sir, why are we keeping the children here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.60,1:18:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm a scientist, Sergeant Lyman.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.40,1:18:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When I build a machine, I wanna make sure that it's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.70,1:18:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, this is a topographic map of the dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.10,1:18:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You see these density changes in the terrain?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.40,1:18:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They're tire tracks. That's the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.40,1:18:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. And this shows the depth of the ice that's covering the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.50,1:18:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, this is recent water activity.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.00,1:18:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we go in there, Stryker could flood the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.20,1:18:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you teleport inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.10,1:18:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. I have to be able to see where I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,otherwise I could wind up inside a wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.20,1:18:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll go. I have a hunch he'll want me alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.60,1:19:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wolverine, whoever goes into the dam needs to be able to operate the spillway mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.50,1:19:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.50,1:19:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scratch it with your claws?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.50,1:19:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.80,1:19:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.00,1:19:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, there's someone coming down the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.40,1:19:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm flooding it. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.20,1:19:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stryker!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.00,1:20:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stryker!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.90,1:20:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, look who's come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.70,1:20:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Move and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.40,1:20:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The one thing I know better than anyone is my own work.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.70,1:20:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Seal the room. Shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.70,1:20:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Seal the room  - Step away!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We have a metamorph loose. Could be anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.30,1:21:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Anybody? What-
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.00,1:21:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you override the spillway mechanism?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.00,1:21:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Everything's controlled from inside that room. That's why the doors are so thick.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.80,1:21:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Get some charges! Blow the doors open!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.80,1:21:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Take out these cameras!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.90,1:21:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.90,1:21:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- She's good. - You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.40,1:22:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Move, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.40,1:22:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sergeant, she's opened the spillway doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- More mutants have entered the base. - How many?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.00,1:22:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We've lost coms. There's some sort of electrical interference-
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.60,1:22:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sergeant Lyman, gather the rest of your men and meet me outside Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.20,1:22:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You carry on. When I come back, I want this door open all the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.10,1:23:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.40,1:23:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't leave me alone, please? - You can come inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.70,1:24:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.50,1:24:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A large portion of energy from the dam has been diverted to this chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.10,1:24:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Cerebro. - There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.80,1:24:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Can you shut it down from here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.10,1:24:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come. There's little time.- Not without us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.30,1:24:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. The children.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.30,1:24:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Kurt, will you come with me? - Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.60,1:24:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where are they?- They're being held in a containment cell one level down.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.10,1:24:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stryker. All right...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.60,1:24:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we'll get the children and meet you at Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.50,1:24:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll try to find Scott and the professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.80,1:24:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Will you be all right without us? - Yeah. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.00,1:24:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's Logan?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.70,1:24:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You, set up a perimeter.  Move, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.50,1:25:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.00,1:25:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.10,1:25:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Time to find our friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.20,1:26:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it time to find our friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.00,1:26:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- All of them. - All of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.30,1:26:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- All of the mutants. - All the mutants?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.00,1:26:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Everywhere. - Everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.40,1:26:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right.  Every one of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.30,1:26:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.  Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.60,1:26:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's time to bring it to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.70,1:26:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.20,1:26:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Just don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.10,1:27:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kill anyone who approaches... even if it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.00,1:27:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go! I'll take care of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.00,1:27:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is one lovef's quarrel we cannot get involved in, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.70,1:27:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.80,1:27:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.00,1:27:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Help us! Anybody! - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.60,1:27:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Help! Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Julie? - Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.80,1:28:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Get us out of here! Okay, we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.50,1:28:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.50,1:28:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.70,1:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean, no, no, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.80,1:29:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.50,1:29:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Scott. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I thought I'd lost you. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.50,1:29:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I could see you, but I couldn't stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.30,1:29:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I tried. I'm sorry. - I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.30,1:29:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- My leg. - Okay, easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.70,1:30:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.50,1:30:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My God. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.80,1:30:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Have you found the mutants yet? Have you found all ofthem?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.00,1:30:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm trying. There are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.60,1:30:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.10,1:32:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The tricky thing about adamantium is...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.60,1:32:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that if you ever manage to process...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.20,1:32:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,its raw, liquid form, you gotta keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.40,1:32:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Keep it hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.70,1:32:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because once the metal cools, it's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.00,1:33:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But you already know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.30,1:33:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I used to thinkyou were one of a kind, Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.80,1:33:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.10,1:35:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.90,1:35:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa. Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.90,1:35:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this kid's table shit. I'm going in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.30,1:35:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,John, they told us to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.30,1:35:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You always do as you're told?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.50,1:36:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the mutants.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.40,1:36:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.40,1:36:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the mutants. Find them all. Each one. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.00,1:36:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good.  Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.30,1:37:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Concentrate. Concentrate harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.80,1:37:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, find them all. Find all the mutants.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.10,1:37:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You, concentrate harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.50,1:37:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kill them. Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.10,1:37:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.10,1:37:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.60,1:38:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Eric, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.20,1:38:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.90,1:39:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How does it look from there, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.70,1:39:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Still fighting the good fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.90,1:39:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,From here, it doesn't look like they're playing by your rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.10,1:39:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time to play by theirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.00,1:40:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's been a change of plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.30,1:40:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.80,1:41:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's been a change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.50,1:41:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now find them. Find them all, the humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.10,1:41:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the humans. Every one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.60,1:41:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How does it feel, bub?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.00,1:41:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Why did you come back? - You cut me open. You took my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.90,1:41:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You make it sound as if I stole something from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.10,1:41:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,As I recall, it was you who volunteered for the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.40,1:41:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who am I? - You...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.60,1:41:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,are just a failed experiment.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.50,1:42:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you really knew about your past...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.60,1:42:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,what kind of person you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.30,1:42:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the work we did togethet-
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.90,1:42:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,People don't change, Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.00,1:42:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You were an animal then. You're an animal now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.80,1:42:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I just gave you claws.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.30,1:42:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell is that? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.70,1:42:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The dam's ruptured. It's gonna flood water into the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.90,1:42:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's trying to relieve the pressure. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.50,1:42:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In a few minutes, we'll all be underwater.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.90,1:42:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come with me, and I'll tell you everything you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.90,1:43:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't help your friends. They're as good as dead, Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.10,1:43:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a survivor, always have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.10,1:43:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought I was just an animal... with claws.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.90,1:43:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we die, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.20,1:43:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There are no answers that way, Wolverine!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the humans. Every one. Find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.20,1:43:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the humans. Find them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.20,1:43:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What is this? - Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.70,1:43:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.40,1:43:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jean. Are you okay? - Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.20,1:43:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.50,1:43:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Professor's still in there... with another mutant.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.80,1:44:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's trapped in some kind of illusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.20,1:44:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.80,1:44:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Magneto's reversed Cerebro. It's not targeting mutants anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.80,1:44:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Who is it targeting? - Everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.50,1:44:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.70,1:44:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Everybody stand back. - Scott, no. His mind is connected to Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.00,1:45:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Opening the door could kill him and everyone his mind is linked to.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.80,1:45:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait. Kurt, I need you to take me inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.40,1:45:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Storm, who is this guy? Who are you? - My name is Kurt Wagner...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.40,1:45:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- but in the Munich circus - He's a teleporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.50,1:45:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you, if I can't see where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.60,1:45:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.20,1:45:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't believe anything you see in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.20,1:45:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.20,1:45:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thy kingdom come, thy will be done on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.30,1:45:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,As it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.40,1:45:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.60,1:45:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.40,1:46:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Professor, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.10,1:46:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You've got to stop Cerebro now. - Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.90,1:46:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.80,1:46:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But she's just a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.30,1:46:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, she's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.20,1:46:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've got my eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.20,1:46:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.80,1:46:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Funny, we keep running into each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.50,1:46:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mark my words, it'll never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.70,1:46:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kurt, it's about to get very cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.80,1:46:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.60,1:46:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.90,1:47:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Find all the humans. Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.60,1:47:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Every single one. Find all the humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Focus. Focus. Find all the humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.10,1:47:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.90,1:48:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason. He's going to be so angry at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.80,1:48:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan. Logan, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.00,1:49:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We have to get out through the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.10,1:49:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't want to go that way. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.10,1:50:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. There's another way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.30,1:50:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The helicopter was right here!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.90,1:51:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will take him. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.40,1:51:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay, Rogue. It's okay. You can let go, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.00,1:51:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Let go. - Go. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.00,1:52:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.40,1:52:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who has the answers, Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.80,1:52:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Those people?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.60,1:52:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That creature in your arms?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.80,1:52:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.70,1:52:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.60,1:52:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,One day, someone will finish what I've started, Wolverine!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.50,1:52:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,One day!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.70,1:53:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott, we've got to get to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.20,1:53:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fear this has gone beyond Alkali Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.40,1:53:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bobby. I got 'im.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.60,1:53:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.80,1:53:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.90,1:53:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's wrong? - Vertical thrusters are off line.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.90,1:53:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- So fix 'em. - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.20,1:53:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Has anyone seen John? - Pyro?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.00,1:53:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.00,1:53:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's with Magneto.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.90,1:53:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Come on! -  Oh, no, we've lost the power.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.00,1:54:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, we need some kind ofexternal power.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.60,1:54:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jean? - Wait. Where isJean?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.30,1:54:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.20,1:55:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, we're not leaving! Lower the ramp!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.30,1:55:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, lower it!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.20,1:55:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.00,1:55:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's controlling the jet.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.00,1:56:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You, get her, now! - She's not letting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.80,1:56:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.30,1:56:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.50,1:56:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- This is... - the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.90,1:56:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.80,1:56:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't do this. - Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.70,1:56:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Oh, no! No! - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.80,1:57:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.80,1:57:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- She's gone. - Don't you say that!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.00,1:57:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- We gotta go back. - She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.60,1:57:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No! No.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.70,1:57:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's gone. She's gone. She's-
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.50,1:57:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.10,1:57:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Lord is my shepherd. I shall not want.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.60,1:57:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He maketh me to lie down in green pastures.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.50,1:58:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yea, though I walk through the valley ofthe shadow ofthe death...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.50,1:58:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will fear no evil...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.50,1:58:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for thou art with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.90,1:58:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today I've been given an opportunity to shed light on recent occurrences...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.70,1:58:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,from the attack that ended in this office.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.00,1:58:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Good morning. - to the unexplained phenomenon that swept the Earth...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.50,1:58:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,nearly annihilating ourway of life. Good morning, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.20,1:58:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do we like this word "annihilating"?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.50,1:58:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.60,1:58:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.00,1:58:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thankyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.30,1:58:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we're live in five, four, three, two
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.00,1:58:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My fellow Americans, in this time ofadversity...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.50,1:59:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we are being offered a moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.90,1:59:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,a moment to recognize a growing threat within our own population...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.90,1:59:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and take a unique role in the shape of human events.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.90,1:59:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Did we just lose the feed? Are we still live?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.30,1:59:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.10,2:00:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, don't be alarmed. We're not going to harm anyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.70,2:00:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who are you people? - We're mutants.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.80,2:00:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My name is Charles Xavier. Please, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.20,2:00:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'd rather stand. - Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.80,2:00:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These files were taken from the private offices ofWilliam Stryker.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.30,2:00:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.60,2:00:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say I know a little girl who can walk through walls.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.60,2:00:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I've never seen this information. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.70,2:00:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then you also know I don't respond well to threats.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.00,2:00:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. President, this is not a threat. This is an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.50,2:00:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There are forces in this world, both mutant and human alike...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.70,2:00:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,who believe that a war is coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.20,2:01:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You will see from those files that some have already tried to start one...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.10,2:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and there have been casualties.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.80,2:01:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Losses on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.30,2:01:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. President...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.50,2:01:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,what you were about to tell the world is true, this is a moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.40,2:01:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A moment to repeat the mistakes of the past...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.20,2:01:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or to work together for a better future.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.10,2:01:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're here to stay, Mr. President. The next move is yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.90,2:01:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll be watching.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.30,2:01:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.30,2:02:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,even when Jean was a student...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.90,2:02:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,she was always hesitant about her powers.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.10,2:02:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Always looking to others.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.00,2:02:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Feeling that in some way she was left behind.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.90,2:02:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you think-
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.90,2:02:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Could we have done more to save her?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.00,2:02:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In the past, she may have let us.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.20,2:03:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There had to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.90,2:03:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did she leave the plane?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.60,2:03:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because she made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.60,2:03:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.30,2:03:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen, she did make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.30,2:03:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.00,2:04:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Professor?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.60,2:04:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.40,2:04:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, I think it will be.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.70,2:04:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, tell me, have any of you read a book...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.70,2:04:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,by an English novelist named T.H. White...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.50,2:04:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,callled The Once and Future King?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.80,2:04:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No? Well-
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.80,2:04:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mutation.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.50,2:04:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is the key to our evolution.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.80,2:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is how we have evolved from a single-celled organism...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.90,2:04:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,into the dominant species on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.00,2:04:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This process is slow...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.90,2:04:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,normally taking thousands and thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.70,2:04:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But every few hundred millennia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从变种人诞生以来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一直被投以恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀疑、憎恶的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,且不谈我们这个星球上的激烈争论
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人会成为 进化之路的一个新起点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抑或成为同样为了生存而挣扎的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一种人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何，这都具有重大的历史意义
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和其它物种分享生存权 从来就不是人类的特色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“我们是朋友，不是敌人”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“我们决不能兄弟阋墙”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“激情或许会一时枯竭”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“骨肉之情却永不能割裂”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是林肯就任美国第十六任总统时 所作的演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是我的座右铭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把票准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要开始参观了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾姬，今天的所有行程取消
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要和我儿子吃饭 - 是，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，您迷路了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来宾登记处有人闯入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 总统先生，有不速之客 - 贾姬，把他带上车
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口也不安全，对方人数不明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走廊有人 - 带他去避难室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里也不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在椭圆办公室外面 - 封锁整个区域
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别开枪！- 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(保障变种人自由)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(亚卡利湖工业区)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的研究一度认为 尼安德特人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在与更为进化的克罗马农人产生竞争时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就已经绝种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是最近的对我们自身的DNA研究表明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两大人种可能发生了混血
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且最终进化成了现代人类
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 换句话说，进化成了 - 我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿蒂 现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，思想集中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,..有时候她这样子真是令人发疯...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得了癌症 - 快进避难室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴？ 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有点头痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止是头痛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但是自从自由岛回来 - 斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就一直不太正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的心灵感应最近不太灵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没法集中精神，一片嘈杂  - 琴，问题不止是你的心灵感应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个月前想让本书飘起来都要全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你现在做恶梦时 整个房间都会震动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的梦越来越可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是觉得有什么可怕的事情要发生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你发生意外的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到鲍比和小淘气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美食街有状况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 问题很琴单 - 你凭什么耍屌？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么那么喜欢耍屌？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有，我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借个火行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉，伙计 - 琴，不要闹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不继续拽了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为了她？ - 你马子爱看我也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她不爱看 - 我们正想乐一乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人乐去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄，你可真逗 你想怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么凶不起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比，你在干吗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是我干的 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后别再炫耀了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸新闻 华盛顿现场报道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白宫椭圆办公室遭到袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体情况还在跟进当中 目前可以确定的是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统和副总统均安然无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消息来源指出这可能是 一名甚至多名变种人所为...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们该走了，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当局已经… - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(X教授 优秀青少年学校)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我看来，万磁王是幕后策划者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不觉得， 斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然艾瑞克可能像这样从监狱中 操纵这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这样做毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且只会妨碍他想让变种人兴旺的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说优等理论 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果艾瑞克继续坚持的话 - 而且，政府会很自然的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次提出变种人注册议案
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许更糟 总统可以宣布戒严
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把所有的变种人扔到牢里去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得行刺总统是单独行动的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到他就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的行动太飘忽不定了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用脑波强化机很难追踪到他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我确切锁定目标以后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风暴女，琴 你们去把他弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超乎想象的险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么， 威廉？ - 要你授权我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行一项特别行动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，谢谢，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你是来跟我谈学校改革计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生，您真幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 参议员 - 总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 感谢您的邀请 - 克雷参议员, 这位是威廉-史崔克上校.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:13:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我上任以来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人一直由他的部门负责
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是变种人注册法案的忠实拥护者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过看来你对变种人的态度有所改变
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为大局着想，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你有什么建议，史崔克先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以坐下吗，总统先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们收集到了一些证据 显示纽约北郊的一个训练机构
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专门训练变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的消息来源可靠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,审问一名自由岛事件的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖分子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克-兰瑟？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你跟他谈过了？ - 没错，万磁王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为他设计了最新的塑料监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个训练机构是个学校 - 毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么鬼东西？ - 喷射器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么喷射器？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是从篮球场就可以起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们事发前可以采取行动...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，听着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威廉，你有权搜查、拘留、审讯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过不要让我在六点新闻看到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人小孩被滥杀的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 史崔克先生? - 克雷参议员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是百合子， 我的私人助理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好强的手劲 - 有什么可以效劳的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要拜访一下 监狱里的艾瑞克-兰瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不是宠物乐园，参议员先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这场冲突中，他是主角
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是观众，不要趟这个浑水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲突？ 史崔克先生 你真的想要挑起战争吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在妈妈怀里吃奶的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经在越南指挥特种行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我提战争
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争早就已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你死定了 - 你才死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太想 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好，你呢？ 这是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是 鲍比. 他是我的… - 我是她男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我低温侠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个可以？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看谁回来了，真巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巧什么？ - 我们正需要一个保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保姆？ - 很高兴再次见到你，罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨, 罗根 - 嗨, 琴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去把喷射器准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧，我们走 - 再见，罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回头见 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女和我打算去波士顿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会离开很久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授想要我们 找到那个袭击总统的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么果然是变种人干的了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里等我们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你又像上次一样偷溜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽量想办法留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你要的东西了吗，罗根？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少找到一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见了 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回家你不欢迎吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的车该加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去加啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗里奥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种状态还要持续多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的刑期有多长？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远 不一定非得要永远的，兰瑟先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你能告诉我我想知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克先生 你能来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是来看看你花了纳税人的钱 把我服侍得够不够舒服吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了，你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兰瑟先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想最后再聊一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于X教授的训练基地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那个所谓的脑波强化机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我可以忍受你在室内抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果你在这里继续抽 你的智力一辈子都会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个六岁的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你做得到吗？ - 我会让琴帮你梳辫子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别，就在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些光线代表地球上的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白色的代表普通人类
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种红色的则是变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.20,0:20:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能通过脑波强化机跟他们连接
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也跟我连接
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到吗，罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的没错 我们并不孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了亚卡利湖的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里什么也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:21:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条虚线显示出 袭击总统的变种人的行动路线
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得很难锁定到他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能更集中注意力和他连接吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我想杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去他终于停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[祷告]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你再扫描一次我的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和上次的结果一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们约好了的 - 心灵不是个随便就能打开的箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它就像是成百万的… - 收起你的演讲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常确定，你的失忆症 你的钢筋铁骨，你的尖牙利爪之间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有着复杂的联系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 罗根…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事得要让心灵自己去发现
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应，等我回来我会再跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你照看我的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特和我今天要去拜访一下老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把那个变种人的坐标传过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们找到他后 尽快把他带回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但愿他能够合作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，为了他自己的性命，保重
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.00,0:23:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克-威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(准许进入)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.40,0:24:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(兰瑟 艾瑞克)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(打印)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(脑波强化机)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(强化机1)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(强化机2)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.10,0:24:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(行动基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(地点：机密)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.90,0:25:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(打印)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.40,0:25:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐标位置就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.40,0:26:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是恶魔的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.10,0:26:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是恶魔的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:27:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后代
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.10,0:27:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会瞬间移动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.80,0:27:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪教授不能锁定他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是来伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去 我是恶魔的使者 我是恶魔的…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听腻了吧？ - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.80,0:27:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算下来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抓住他了？ - 他跑不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要杀我 我不想杀害任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么别人都不是这么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的名字是？ - 瓦格纳，克特-瓦格纳
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.60,0:28:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(柏林马戏团)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.60,0:28:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里满是枪声
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛苦…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我眼看着它发生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却没法阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:24.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直像个恶梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他在考验我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你进白宫之前的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.00,0:28:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么也没有 我就是在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.10,0:28:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想带他去见教授
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.60,0:29:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.30,0:29:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你再读一次我的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果肯定还是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.80,0:29:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你会拥有金刚不坏之身 - 没有记忆了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事情要靠心灵自己去发现
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.70,0:29:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有记忆，你将会失去记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡不着？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？ - 因为你醒着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.30,0:30:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.60,0:30:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来不睡
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.00,0:30:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的人都不用睡觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.00,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很明显啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有啤酒吗？ - 这里是学校
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以答案是没有？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.00,0:30:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了巧克力和牛奶就没有别的了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柜子里有苏打水
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把他弄出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题，斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 墨镜很酷嘛 - 谢谢夸奖
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:32:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯-泽维尔 你是来救我的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，艾瑞克，今天不行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俗话说无事不登三宝殿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.00,0:32:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击总统的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道多少？ - 除了报纸上的新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全不必问我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.80,0:32:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威廉-史崔克 经常来拜访我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.40,0:32:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得这家伙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.30,0:32:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威廉-史崔克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他儿子詹森，曾经是你的学生 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.10,0:32:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，很多年以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.20,0:32:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不幸的是，我帮不了他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.00,0:32:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少不像他父亲希望的那样帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你接纳狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能弥补当年他儿子的遗憾？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:32:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来这里多久了？ - 好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.80,0:33:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你父母要送你进变种人学校的？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上他们以为这里是大学预科班
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.90,0:33:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.10,0:33:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很多预科班都有独立的宿舍和校园 - 喷射器
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和罗杰… - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望是这样 但总是事与愿违…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想接近一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却办不到是件
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛苦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到你看葛雷博士的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.00,0:33:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么？ - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.70,0:33:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有告诉他你的过去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.30,0:33:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绕过了没提
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.60,0:33:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根的精神还是很脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.30,0:33:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很怕失去一个挚爱的X战警吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.00,0:33:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.50,0:34:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克，你干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.60,0:34:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.10,0:34:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟史崔克说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.70,0:34:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.30,0:34:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战鼓已经擂响
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特! 你有机会的时候早该杀了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.50,0:35:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.70,0:35:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈经常会离开孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.70,0:35:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了妈妈，孩子们岌岌可危…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.80,0:35:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 嘘 嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你选错了房子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.90,0:37:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这儿别动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.70,0:37:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点，快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.70,0:38:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行动！行动！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.80,0:38:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走这边 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰！罗杰呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.00,0:38:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 打开 - 这里，帮一把
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续，进去，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.90,0:39:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮他一把，他昏过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.00,0:39:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来帮你 - 帮他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗杰！ - 鲍比！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.90,0:39:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来，大伙加油
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.20,0:39:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.30,0:40:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，这边
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.80,0:40:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.90,0:40:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想杀了我吗？发射啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.00,0:40:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别射他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机未到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.90,0:40:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.00,0:40:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.40,0:40:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会在这里碰上你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有多久没见了，15年？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.70,0:40:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点都没变
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.10,0:40:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一方面，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.80,0:41:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然规律
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.50,0:41:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下，我们得采取行动 他们会杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他能保护好自己，我们走 - 鲍比.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.50,0:41:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想到泽维尔还会训练动物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至你这种德行的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.20,0:41:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.70,0:41:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.90,0:41:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.40,0:41:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，来，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 走，我没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.30,0:42:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走，别停下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.90,0:42:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好，进去 - 我来驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.20,0:42:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.30,0:42:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是独眼龙的车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.40,0:43:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么鬼地方，这么黑？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.20,0:43:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克.他名叫史崔克.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.30,0:43:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.50,0:43:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.90,0:43:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去 这是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.70,0:43:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌这么安静，不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.40,0:43:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.30,0:44:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这个不是随身听
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们去哪里？ - 暴风女和琴在波士顿 去找他们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.20,0:44:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的父母都住在波士顿 - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.00,0:44:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多变种人从地道逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.90,0:44:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在监管室抓到几个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.90,0:44:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 几个？ - 六个，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.10,0:45:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.60,0:45:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们需要的都带走，先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个提案显示
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.30,0:45:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当前国民普遍关心的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.00,0:45:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 变种人注册 - 注册还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆全部装卡车运进集中营
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.60,0:45:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或者你更喜欢全面的战争？ - 拜托…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.40,0:45:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看这些狗屎，罗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有心事？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗里奥先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是葛雷斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.10,0:46:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要啤酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.20,0:46:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.50,0:46:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你很主动 - 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.00,0:46:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还从来没你这样的姑娘吸引住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.20,0:46:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.50,0:46:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真够脏的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.80,0:46:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏不是挺好的 维克牢？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.60,0:46:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很不错 - 干杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.80,0:46:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.20,0:47:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.10,0:47:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 威廉… - 泽维尔，不必站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.00,0:47:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西叫神经抑制器
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你无法发挥能力
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.90,0:47:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对斯科特干了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.90,0:47:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 只是给教他一点新知识
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对此再清楚不过，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.40,0:47:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我治好你儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.60,0:47:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但是变种并不是一种疾病 - 你胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.70,0:48:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我还怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.80,0:48:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹森从你的学校回来后一年
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.10,0:48:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.10,0:48:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，他恨我们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.10,0:48:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怨我们造成了他现在的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.70,0:48:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是就以折磨我们的思想为乐
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.40,0:48:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们的脑中充满幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.50,0:48:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后，我妻子她…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.90,0:48:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了赶走那些恐怖的幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.20,0:48:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用电钻钻进了太阳穴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.00,0:48:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子… 是个幻想大师
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.30,0:48:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使像你这么痛恨变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.50,0:48:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是和他们成为同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要控制有方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.30,0:48:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还是很能干的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.50,0:49:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击总统的事件是你策划的？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.30,0:49:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用读我的心思就能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和变种人合作的时间 一点也不比你短
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过最令人发愁的是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.80,0:49:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远不知道世界上有多少变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.70,0:49:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及怎么找出他们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.60,0:49:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.30,0:49:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜，这些药对你来说有点太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.10,0:49:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量强大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们只好另辟蹊径
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请允许我向您介绍 变种人143号
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.50,0:49:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑部分泌的液体可控制他人的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.20,0:49:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过目前还处于试验阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹森？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.50,0:49:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天那，威廉，这是你的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.20,0:49:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你对他干了什么？ - 不，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.50,0:50:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.40,0:50:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈？爸爸？罗尼？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有谁在家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.90,0:50:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来找件衣服给你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.00,0:50:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别玩火
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.90,0:50:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到几件我妈的旧衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.50,0:50:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是我出生以前的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.60,0:51:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很一般
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.30,0:51:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴，你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.90,0:51:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我祖母的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.20,0:51:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.50,0:51:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.40,0:52:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.20,0:52:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗尼，下次换你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.70,0:52:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.60,0:53:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.80,0:53:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该在学校里吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.50,0:53:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍比，这家伙是谁？ - 这是罗根教授
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.80,0:53:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点事要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.80,0:53:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(检测)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.80,0:53:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(扫描完成)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得好吗，兰瑟？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.40,0:54:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有点不太正常
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.30,0:54:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.90,0:54:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.40,0:54:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我他妈的坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.70,0:54:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.10,0:54:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.00,0:54:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.40,0:54:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血液中铁含量过高
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.70,0:54:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗里奥先生, 永远不要相信美女
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.30,0:54:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是当她对你有兴趣的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.00,0:55:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么时候知道自己…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.30,0:55:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个变种人的？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.70,0:55:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不提这些吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:55:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须理解
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.90,0:56:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以为鲍比念的是天才学校
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.20,0:56:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鲍比的确是个天才 - 我们知道，只是还不太明白…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.60,0:56:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直都爱你， 鲍比. 只是变种人的问题有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.50,0:56:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么变种人的问题？ - …很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.30,0:56:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是研究什么的教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.50,0:56:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.40,0:56:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得看看 鲍比 的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.00,0:56:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.30,0:56:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的能力决不止于此
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗尼
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都是我的错 - 实际上…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.90,0:56:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是他的错
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这基因来自男性亲代
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是911. 请说明你的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.30,0:57:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要警察，有人闯进我家
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.80,0:57:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胁持我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追捕行动
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在展开
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.40,0:57:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有回应，失去信号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你休息一下吧，我来继续
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.90,0:57:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[祷告]
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.40,0:57:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[祷告]
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.40,0:57:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.30,0:58:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是大天使加百利
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带到人间的天使的图腾
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.20,0:58:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常美 你有几种？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.00,0:58:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每种罪恶都有相对应的一种
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不少
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.40,0:58:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和葛雷小姐是老师吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.50,0:58:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，在我们这种人的学校 保护我们的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.90,0:58:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护谁的安全？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.20,0:58:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.70,0:58:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马戏团以外的人都很怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.40,0:58:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我不恨他们，我只怜悯他们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.20,0:58:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.70,0:58:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝大多数人对他们肉眼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.90,0:58:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到的世界一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.00,0:58:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很早就开始不再同情他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此美丽的人不该这样愤怒的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.50,0:59:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能救命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.60,0:59:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信仰也可以救命
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.60,0:59:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女，我找到联络设备了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.00,0:59:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.00,0:59:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝，这是给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.20,0:59:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲍比
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有试过把自己当作正常人？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.80,0:59:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不剩，琴，有军队来过了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.40,0:59:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 孩子们呢？ - 我看到一部分人逃脱，其他人下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.30,0:59:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授和斯科特都联络不上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.20,0:59:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在哪里？ - 波士顿，和 鲍比-达瑞克一家在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,1:00:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很好，我们上路了 - 暴风女，快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.90,1:00:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们要出发了 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.50,1:00:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.60,1:00:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扔掉刀子，举起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事？ - 罗尼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.30,1:00:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说把刀子扔掉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.00,1:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 撞开它
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.30,1:00:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转过去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.70,1:00:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对着墙站好 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.20,1:00:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这都是误会 - 放下刀子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.30,1:00:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我办不到
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.90,1:00:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.60,1:00:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人，都给我趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.50,1:00:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子，我说趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.30,1:01:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不想伤害你，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.60,1:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听过新闻，知道变种人很危险吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.00,1:01:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是最危险的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是谁？ - 克特-瓦格纳
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.90,1:03:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马戏团里的称号是“不可思议的蓝魔鬼”
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 省点力气吧，暴风女 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.30,1:03:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹森，停下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.50,1:04:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.80,1:04:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以出来了 - 他们都走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.10,1:04:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.70,1:04:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其他的学生都去哪了？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.90,1:04:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们要找到他们才行
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.30,1:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用脑波强化器来找
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.90,1:04:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.90,1:05:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有多远？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就快到学校上空了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.70,1:05:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号显示有两架飞机向我们飞来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.20,1:05:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度很快
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.50,1:05:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明身份飞机, 命令你立即下降到2万英尺
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.80,1:05:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我们护送返回汗斯卡姆空军基地 限你10秒钟之内照办
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.40,1:05:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇哦,脾气不小 - 为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.40,1:05:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将接近你们侧方, 护送你们前往汗斯卡姆空军基地
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请立即降低高度
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.40,1:05:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复：下降到2万英尺 这是最后一次警告
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们撤后了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在锁定我们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.20,1:05:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 要开火了，坐稳
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.10,1:06:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要甩掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.60,1:06:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请别再那么干了 - 我同意
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.70,1:06:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这破玩意儿上就没武器么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.70,1:06:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警报 警报 警报
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.90,1:07:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警报 警报 警报 警报 警报
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.50,1:07:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警报 警报 警报 警报 警报 警报
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.60,1:07:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警报 警报 警报
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.80,1:07:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家都还好吗？ - 不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.80,1:07:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊，有两枚导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.50,1:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一枚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.40,1:08:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.90,1:08:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.30,1:08:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.10,1:09:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 琴？ - 不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.60,1:09:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙什么时候才能学会开飞机？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.10,1:09:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能听到他们说话吗？ - 我可以再凑近瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.60,1:09:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是威廉 史崔克上校
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.70,1:09:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他袭击学校的目的只有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是得到脑波强化器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.00,1:10:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者收集足够的部件自己再造一个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.60,1:10:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那说不通啊 史崔克一定要教授才能操作啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.00,1:10:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这正是我的老朋友还活着的唯一原因
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.00,1:10:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.80,1:10:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都在害怕什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.60,1:10:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑波强化器工作时 查尔斯的大脑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.10,1:10:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会与地球上每个人相连
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.30,1:10:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他被迫将足够强的意识 集中在某个特定人群上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.10,1:10:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如：变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.10,1:10:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他能把我们都杀死 - 等等，首先告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.60,1:10:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克怎么会知道脑波强化器在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.50,1:10:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉他的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.70,1:10:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得么？是我帮着查尔斯制造的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.10,1:10:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克先生的说服能力很强
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.50,1:10:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使像查尔斯那样强大的变种人都无法抵抗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.10,1:10:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那这个史崔克到底是什么人？ - 他是个军方科学家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.00,1:11:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一生致力于解决变种人的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.10,1:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想知道的更详细一点, 为什么不去问问狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.90,1:11:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得了吧,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.60,1:11:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除我之外 威廉 史崔克是唯一能处理合成细胞的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.90,1:11:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骨骼里的金属就是他的杰作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.90,1:11:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但是教授 - 他相信
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.40,1:11:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会自己发现这件事的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.10,1:11:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他比我更加相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.00,1:11:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么需要我们帮忙？ - 变色龙发现了史崔克建立基地的蓝图
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.80,1:11:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里已经运行几十年了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.20,1:11:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道他在那里造第二台脑波强化器
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.50,1:11:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知道基地的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.30,1:11:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为你们有人知道
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.80,1:11:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 教授已经试过了 - 你又认为你是主角
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.70,1:11:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.60,1:12:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不是故意要偷听的 - 尽量放松
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.90,1:12:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克在亚克利湖
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.30,1:12:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授就是让我去那里的 那里什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.40,1:12:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地面上是没什么，罗根 基地在地底下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:13:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.50,1:13:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还好 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.00,1:13:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 飞机怎么样？ - 不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.30,1:13:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来要花4,5个小时才能修好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.20,1:13:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是问这个
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.40,1:13:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有点担心斯科特 - 我却担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.90,1:13:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才在天上你的表现令人惊讶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.90,1:13:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明显还不够 - 打起精神
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.30,1:13:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱他
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.90,1:13:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩们喜欢与危险的家伙调情，罗根
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.50,1:13:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却不会带他回家
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.60,1:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们会嫁给好男人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.40,1:13:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以当好男人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.40,1:13:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，好男人不会到处跑的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.80,1:13:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 琴  - 不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.40,1:14:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要逼我这样 - 怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.80,1:14:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.20,1:14:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打搅一下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.90,1:14:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说你能模仿任何人 连声音都能模仿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.50,1:14:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连声音都能模仿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.10,1:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那干吗不一直伪装呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.90,1:14:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说… 让自己像其他人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没这个必要
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.70,1:15:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能像你给我留下这样的疤痕
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么？道歉？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.60,1:15:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.90,1:15:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.40,1:15:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你滚出去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.50,1:16:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.90,1:16:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么没有制服？ - 对啊，我们的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经订了 再过几年应该会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.00,1:16:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你做的发型
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.80,1:16:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿！ 算了，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.60,1:16:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说你是坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.70,1:16:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们这么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.10,1:16:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个甲虫似的头盔真丑 干什么用的？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.20,1:16:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这个丑头盔才能保护
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.00,1:17:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不受真正的坏蛋伤害
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.10,1:17:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？ - 约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.10,1:17:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的真名呢？约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.70,1:17:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火人，你的本事相当棒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.90,1:17:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能舞火
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.90,1:17:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能造火
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.70,1:17:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是渺渺众生中的神
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.90,1:17:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让人察觉你的非同凡响
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.50,1:18:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官，机器已经按预定完成
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.60,1:18:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想问 我们干吗还要留着这些孩子？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.60,1:18:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个科学家，莱曼中尉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.40,1:18:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我造的机器一定要能用
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.70,1:18:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看，这是大坝的地形图
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是泄洪道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.10,1:18:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到这些疏密相间的图像了么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.40,1:18:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是轮胎印 这是入口
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.40,1:18:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这显示了地上冰层的厚度
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.50,1:18:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最近水流活动的记录
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.00,1:18:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们进去，史崔克会往泄洪道放水的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.20,1:18:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能瞬移到里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.10,1:18:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能我一定要看到要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然可能会困在墙里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.20,1:18:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去 我感到他不想我死
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.60,1:19:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，进入大坝的人 要能能操作泄洪装置才行
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.50,1:19:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.50,1:19:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你的爪子抓？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.50,1:19:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赌一赌
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.80,1:19:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.00,1:19:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官，有人进入泄洪道了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.40,1:19:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来把他冲出去 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.20,1:19:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.00,1:20:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.90,1:20:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看，谁回家了？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.70,1:20:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再动一下你就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.40,1:20:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己的杰作谁也不如我了解
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.70,1:20:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,封闭房间，打死他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.70,1:20:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 封闭房间 - 站开
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混进来个变形人 有可能伪装成任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.30,1:21:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何人？ 怎么…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.00,1:21:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能操控泄洪装置吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.00,1:21:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能在这房间里控制 所以门才会这么厚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.80,1:21:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，真的么？ 找些炸药，把门炸开
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.80,1:21:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把摄像机打掉
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.90,1:21:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.90,1:21:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她干的不错 - 还有你没见识过的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.40,1:22:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要引爆了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快，快
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.40,1:22:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她打开闸门了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.70,1:22:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 又有变种人进来了 - 多少？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.00,1:22:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯中断了，电磁干扰
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.60,1:22:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱曼中尉，带你的人到 脑波强化器前跟我会合
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.20,1:22:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们接着干 在我回来前，一定要把这门打开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.10,1:23:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.40,1:23:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请别丢下我 - 你可以进来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.70,1:24:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.50,1:24:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大坝的能量有很大一部分汇集到这间房里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.10,1:24:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 脑波强化器 - 就在那
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.80,1:24:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能在这关上它吗？ - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.10,1:24:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快，没有时间了 - 一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.30,1:24:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.30,1:24:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 库尔特，你和我一起去么？ - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.60,1:24:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪？ - 在下面一层
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.10,1:24:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克！ 史崔克！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.60,1:24:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去救孩子 然后在脑波强化器和你们会合
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.50,1:24:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找斯科特和教授
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.80,1:24:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一个人能行么？ - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.00,1:24:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.70,1:24:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都守在这
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.50,1:25:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹森
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.00,1:25:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.10,1:25:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该找我们的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.20,1:26:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该去找我们的朋友的时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.00,1:26:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有的人 - 所有的人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.30,1:26:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有的变种人 - 所有的变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.00,1:26:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所有地方的 - 所有地方的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.40,1:26:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 每一个人？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.30,1:26:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.60,1:26:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.70,1:26:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做得完美
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.20,1:26:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.10,1:27:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠近者，格杀勿论 包括我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.00,1:27:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走，我能应付他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.00,1:27:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的，清官难断家务事，我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.70,1:27:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.80,1:27:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.00,1:27:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救命！ - 听
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.60,1:27:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！救我们出去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 金勃莉？ - 暴风女
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.80,1:28:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我们出去 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.50,1:28:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.50,1:28:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特，住手
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.70,1:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴，不要紧 没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.80,1:29:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了，是我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.50,1:29:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯科特 - 真对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还以为你死了 - 哦，上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.50,1:29:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真抱歉 我看到是你，但就是控制不了自己
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.30,1:29:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我尽力了 对不起 - 我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.30,1:29:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的腿 - 放松
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.70,1:30:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.50,1:30:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.40,1:30:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天呀 不
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.80,1:30:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到变种人了么？ 你找到所有变种人了么？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.00,1:30:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在努力，人太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.60,1:30:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么集中精神
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.10,1:32:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成釉细胞有个怪异特性
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.60,1:32:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你令它控制在
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.20,1:32:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原始液体形态 你就得设法让它保持这种状态
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.40,1:32:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持高温
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.70,1:32:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它一旦冷却 就将坚不可摧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.00,1:33:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这你已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.30,1:33:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾认为你是独一无二的，狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.80,1:33:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，天呀
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.10,1:35:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.90,1:35:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.90,1:35:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等够了，我要进去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.30,1:35:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰，他们让我们呆在这
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.30,1:35:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道永远都这么听话？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.50,1:36:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有的变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.40,1:36:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的，找到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.40,1:36:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有的变种人 每个角落，每个人，所有的人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.00,1:36:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后杀死他们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.30,1:37:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神，再集中
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.80,1:37:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在去找他们,找到所有的变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.10,1:37:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再集中，找到每个人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.50,1:37:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他们 把他们全部杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.10,1:37:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.10,1:37:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑波强化器
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间不够了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.60,1:38:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克，快点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.20,1:38:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.90,1:39:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那看起来怎么样？查尔斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.70,1:39:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在打正义之战？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.90,1:39:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在起 他们好像不再按我们的规则来了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.10,1:39:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许该按他们的规则来了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.00,1:40:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划变了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.30,1:40:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.80,1:41:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划变了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.50,1:41:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在找到他们 找到所有的人类
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.10,1:41:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有的人类 每一个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.60,1:41:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样，杂种？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.00,1:41:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么回来？ - 你把我开膛破肚，夺走了我的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.90,1:41:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的好像我偷了你东西似的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.10,1:41:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你是自愿参与实验的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.40,1:41:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是谁？ - 你…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.60,1:41:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是件失败的试验品
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.50,1:42:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真知道你的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.60,1:42:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.30,1:42:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾经一起干的勾当
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.90,1:42:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人不会变的，狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.00,1:42:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过去是禽兽，现在也是
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.80,1:42:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是给了你利爪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.30,1:42:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什么事了？ 到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.70,1:42:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大坝裂开了 水会涌进泄洪道
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.90,1:42:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试过释放压力 但太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.50,1:42:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再过几分钟 我们都会被淹没
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.90,1:42:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来 你想知道什么我都告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.90,1:43:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮不了你的朋友 他们死定了，狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.10,1:43:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是幸存者 一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.10,1:43:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾认为自己 只是头长着利爪的野兽
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.90,1:43:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们死了 你也别想活着
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.20,1:43:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边你是找不到答案的，狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有的人类 每一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.20,1:43:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有的人类，每一个，杀死他们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.20,1:43:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 脑波强化器
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.70,1:43:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.40,1:43:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 琴，你没事吧？ - 我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.20,1:43:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.50,1:43:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授和一个变种人在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.80,1:44:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他陷入了某种幻觉
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.20,1:44:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，天呐
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.80,1:44:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝脑波强化器被逆置了 这回目标不是变种人了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.80,1:44:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？ - 人类
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.50,1:44:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.70,1:44:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都退后 - 不，他现在连在脑波强化器上
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.00,1:45:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开门会杀死他 和所有跟他思维相连的人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.80,1:45:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，克特，我需要你把我送进去
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.40,1:45:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这家伙是谁？你是谁？ - 我是克特 瓦格纳
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.40,1:45:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来自马戏团 - 他会瞬间移动
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.50,1:45:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过，如果看不到要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.60,1:45:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你有信心
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.20,1:45:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里看到任何事都别相信
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.20,1:45:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天父，愿荣耀属于你
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.20,1:45:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天国即将降临 人间
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.30,1:45:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犹如天堂
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.40,1:45:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.60,1:45:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.40,1:46:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授，你能听见么？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.10,1:46:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得马上停止脑波强化器 - 你在和谁说话？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.90,1:46:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.80,1:46:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不过是个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.30,1:46:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，她不是
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.20,1:46:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经注意到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.20,1:46:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史崔克先生
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.80,1:46:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有趣，总是碰到你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.50,1:46:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证这不会再发生了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.70,1:46:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克特，这里将变得很冷
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.80,1:46:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会呆着的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.60,1:46:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.90,1:47:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到所有人类 杀掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.60,1:47:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个人 找到所有人类
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精神 找到所有人类
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.10,1:47:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.90,1:48:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹森 他会生我气的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.80,1:48:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.00,1:49:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须穿过泄洪道
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.10,1:49:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要走那条路，相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.10,1:50:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有另一条路出去
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.30,1:50:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直升机刚才就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.90,1:51:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来抱他
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.40,1:51:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事，罗杰 你可以放手了，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.00,1:51:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放手 - 放心  我没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.00,1:52:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.40,1:52:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁才知道答案,狼人？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.80,1:52:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.60,1:52:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抱着的那些？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.80,1:52:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.70,1:52:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意和他一起冒险
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.60,1:52:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天，会有人会完成我的工作，狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.50,1:52:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.70,1:53:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.20,1:53:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这恐怕已不仅是亚克利湖的问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.40,1:53:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住他了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.60,1:53:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.80,1:53:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.90,1:53:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出什么问题了？ - 推进器坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.90,1:53:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那快修啊 - 我试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.20,1:53:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有人看到约翰了吗？ - 火人？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.00,1:53:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.00,1:53:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和万磁王在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.90,1:53:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 哦，不 我们失去了动力
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.00,1:54:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯科特,我们需要一些外力推动
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.60,1:54:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 琴？ - 等等 琴在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.30,1:54:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在外面
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.20,1:55:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能走 放下舷梯
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.30,1:55:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女,放舷梯
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.20,1:55:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放不了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.00,1:55:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在控制飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.00,1:56:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你马上去救她 - 她不让我去
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.80,1:56:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.30,1:56:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我清楚我在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.50,1:56:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是… - 唯一的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.90,1:56:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴 听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.80,1:56:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要这样 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.70,1:56:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不！不！ - 不！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.80,1:57:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.80,1:57:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她死了 - 不要那样说
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.00,1:57:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们要回去 - 她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.60,1:57:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有！没有
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.70,1:57:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了 她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.50,1:57:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.10,1:57:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝是我的牧羊人
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.60,1:57:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让我能躺在如茵的绿地上
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.50,1:58:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我走过死亡的幽谷
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.50,1:58:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无惧邪恶
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.50,1:58:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为主与我同在
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.90,1:58:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我将就最近
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.70,1:58:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椭圆办公室袭击事件…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.00,1:58:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 到横扫全球的各种几乎彻底
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.50,1:58:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,湮灭我们生活方式的奇怪现象
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.20,1:58:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“彻底湮灭”这个词好么？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.50,1:58:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.60,1:58:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.00,1:58:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.30,1:58:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生，马上开始直播… 五，四，三，二…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.00,1:58:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的美国同胞们，在这逆境之中
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.50,1:59:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们迎来了关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.90,1:59:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此时我们要认清 在我们当中逐渐增长的威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.90,1:59:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并在人类历史上扮演一个独特角色
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.90,1:59:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,广播中断了吗？还在直播吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.30,1:59:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.10,2:00:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张 我们不会伤害任何人
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.70,2:00:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们是谁？ - 我们是变种人
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.80,2:00:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫查尔斯 泽维尔 请坐
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.20,2:00:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我宁愿站着 - 罗杰
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.80,2:00:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些文件是在威廉 史崔克的 私人办公室找到的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.30,2:00:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么拿到的？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.60,2:00:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当我认识 一个会穿墙的小姑娘吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.60,2:00:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我从没见过这些资料 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.70,2:00:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道我不会在威逼下谈判
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.00,2:00:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生 这不是威逼 这是个机会
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.50,2:00:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上的人类和变种人
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.70,2:00:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有一部分相信战争即将来临
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.20,2:01:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些文件可以说明
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.10,2:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有人在挑起争端
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.80,2:01:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们双方都有损伤
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.30,2:01:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.50,2:01:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要对全世界说的话是真的 现在是关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.40,2:01:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是重复过去的错误
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.20,2:01:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是携手开创美好未来
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.10,2:01:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会留下来的，总统先生 下面看你的了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.90,2:01:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拭目以待
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.30,2:01:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.30,2:02:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴即使在学生时代
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.90,2:02:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也始终对自己的能力半信半疑
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.10,2:02:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她总是看着别人
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.00,2:02:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得自己在某些方面 被抛弃了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.90,2:02:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们当时
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.90,2:02:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不可能做点什么来救她？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.00,2:02:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在过去，她可能会让我们救她
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.20,2:03:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定另有办法的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.90,2:03:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为什么要离开飞机？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.60,2:03:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她已做抉择
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.60,2:03:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.30,2:03:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 她确实已做抉择
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.30,2:03:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.00,2:04:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.60,2:04:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都顺利么？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.40,2:04:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，我想会的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.70,2:04:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家有没有谁读过这本小说？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.70,2:04:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国作家TH怀特写的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.50,2:04:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫《永恒之王》的书
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.80,2:04:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.80,2:04:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变异
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.50,2:04:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我们进化的关键
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.80,2:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变异使我们从单细胞生物
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.90,2:04:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化成地球上的统治物种
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.00,2:04:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个过程非常缓慢
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.90,2:04:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通常要花千万年的时间
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.70,2:04:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但每几十万年进化过程都会发生跃进
